       drawn exactly over the (white) slide, whose anti-aliased edge showed as a light rim around the dark card, so in
       dark the frame is rebuilt with a 2px spread of the card's own surface first, then the hairline and the slide shadow. */
    html[data-theme="dark"] .ds-shell .slide-gen-card {
