/* Redesign surfaces (.ds-shell): the shared Button's tooltip is the ds Tooltip bubble — control radius, 4/8px padding,
   12px medium text, menu shadow, no arrow (user, 2026-10-22 "update all tooltips"). Plain CSS with literal values: this file
   compiles under every brand config, and only pai defines the ds tokens. */
.ds-shell .button-tooltip {
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 16px;
